env registries and drift gates; shared Gerrit-hook safety; Verified triage; Git floor, timeout, version, and transient-write rules; guide/criterion parity; header mapping ownership; asymmetric-only op-certs; and identity placeholder resolution. Pytest collection and the generator scripts are the real consumers.\n\n## Independent review receipt\nA reviewer who did not author the patch posts exactly 29 leaf-linked TSV PASS rows:\n`stable_block_id<TAB>before_citation<TAB>final_citation<TAB>preserved_contract_or_consumer<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>semantic-preservation<TAB>bloat-removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\n\nBefore citations are `72e58f613ab52a393c35b3225a51490b72364c62:<path>#<stable-id>`; final citations use the full final commit SHA. Every row has `after_words < before_words` and `directives_exact=PASS`, `semantic-preservation=PASS`, and `bloat-removal=PASS`. Missing, duplicate, extra, author-reviewed, or non-PASS rows block closure.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Exactly 29 allowlisted stable IDs are changed.\n- [ ] Every changed block has `after_words > 0`.\n- [ ] Every changed block has `after_words < before_words`.\n- [ ] Every unlisted prose block remains byte-identical.\n- [ ] The recorded `semantic` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The recorded `directives` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The recorded `paths` command exits 0 for exactly 36 grouped commit paths (18 owned by this leaf).\n- [ ] The recorded `diff` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The recorded `focused` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The recorded `hygiene` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The recorded untimed `full` command exits 0.\n- [ ] The independent TSV contains exactly 29 rows.\n- [ ] The TSV stable IDs are unique.\n- [ ] Every TSV row cites the frozen base.\n- [ ] Every TSV row cites the full final commit SHA.\n- [ ] Every TSV row names a non-author reviewer session.\n- [ ] Every TSV row has `directives_exact=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every TSV row has `semantic-preservation=PASS`.\n- [ ] Every TSV row has